$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~10 min | Difficulty: Medium]] The Cylons run a patrol down a lane through the rocks every few minutes. The Nightjars sit in the dark, wait for the lead Raider to come within range, and strike. No warning, no quarter.", -1)
$end_multi_text

