$start_briefing
$num_stages: 1
$start_stage
$multi_text
 XSTR("The Cylons run a patrol down a lane through the rocks every few minutes. The Nightjars sit in the dark, wait for the lead Raider to come within range, and strike. No warning, no quarter. Objectives. Destroy every ship of the patrol and break contact.", -1)
$end_multi_text
